<mxCell id="t94" value="Decide whether the design team should review training now. Answer wait while the goal measures are still improving, and wake once they have levelled off or are moving away from the goal. A plateau is not excused as early learning or as adaptation to a new norm." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="286" y="66" width="860" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
